Error [jet.TypestateUnknownState]: `Drafted` is not a declared state of `Order`
  --> tests/ui/typestate/state_type_names_unknown_state.jet:9:22
    |
  9 |     ship: fn(self: &&Order.Drafted) -> Order.Shipped { self }
    |                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate: `Order: struct { state { … } }` defines the valid state labels; `Drafted` is not among them — a typo here would silently create a phantom state that no transition reaches
 Fix: Did you mean `Draft`? Check the `Order: struct { state { … } }` declaration for valid names
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0151
